  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ArweaveOASIS v2.0.7\n\nWEB4 OASIS API ArweaveOASIS Provider — permanent decentralised storage for the OASIS via the Arweave network.\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.6\n- Add bounded owner-pinned Arweave CQL adapter with execution tests (e2a3db1)\n- Implement exact historical Arweave CQL source with tested manager demo (1667c3d)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Preserve Arweave read failures instead of returning record misses (f9a1fa7)\n- Publish Arweave save receipts only after valid acknowledgement (d11cf9f)\n- Reject incomplete Arweave GraphQL results and traverse native pages (dc09956)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ArweaveOASIS",
